@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+# Rules for importers
+
+- Every change to an importer also updates that importer's section in `docs/FORMAT.md`, so the
+  documented format and the parser never disagree.
+- An importer rejects a malformed row with an error that names the line number; it never skips it
+  silently.
